  "citation": "Ciattaglia L; Chamard P (1997): Atmospheric Carbon Dioxide Record from Flask Measurements at Lampedusa Island (May 1992- December 2000). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/ATG.022",
